    This file is not a resource. At build time, GenerateAppIconsTask (build.gradle.kts) writes one
    copy per palette, with {icon} replaced by the palette's name: @drawable/app_icon_<icon>_foreground,
    used by the adaptive icon @mipmap/app_icon_<icon>.

    Traced from the approved Folded A artwork (viewBox 64 64 352 352, moved to the origin) and
    scaled into the adaptive icon safe zone by the group transform.
-->
